+# fm
+
+A small Click-based file-management CLI.
+
+## Commands
+
+- `python -m tools.fm.cli list <root>`
+- `python -m tools.fm.cli move <src> <dst>`
+- `python -m tools.fm.cli tag <path> <tag>`
+- `python -m tools.fm.cli search-by-tag <root> <tag>`
+
+Tags are stored in `<root>/.fm.db` using SQLite. Paths are stored relative to
+the managed root.
+
+## Test
+
+Run from this directory:
+
+```bash
+pytest
+```
+
